@ 26.12 - Proto-Mande to Soninka
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Dwyer, David J. (1987/1988), “Towards Proto Mande Morphology”. Mandekan: Bulletin semestriel d’études linguistiques 14/15:139 – 152 NB: These changes only deal with consonants.
	p > f
	tʼ {kʼ,ɡ} > {t,d} k
	z > j ?
	{w,ŋ} > j
